    <string name="smart_card">A language model on this device</string>
    <string name="smart_body">Luister mee then reads the weekly meeting with a small language model, next to the fixed rules, so it also recognises sentences the way you say them. The model runs on this device itself: what you say goes nowhere. Switching it on downloads it once (about 130 MB); switching it off removes it again.</string>
